{"title":"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> equal the product of 3,659,893,456,789,325,678 and 342,973,489,379,256. The number of digits in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/b/71bf467a3c98fb03774748f45320529ded234501.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 36\\quad \\text{(B) } 35\\quad \\text{(C) } 34\\quad \\text{(D) } 33\\quad \\text{(E) } 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"309\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Through inspection, we see that the two digit number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/3/5d370dfc39b5db4f9a672931c2c059fadd68eb51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$33^{2}=1089=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"119\" height=\"15\" /> digits.\nNotice that any number that has the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/e/48e18276847d0839cf76fe354c3b41a9c2f27447.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$33abcdefg.......$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"115\" height=\"16\" /> multiplied by another <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/c/96c690c03951681aad4b52867c9afd31815c9567.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$33qwertyu.........$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\" /> will have its number of digits equal to the sum of the original numbers' digits.\n</p><p>In this case, we see that the first number has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> digits, and the second number has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> digits.\n</p><p>Note: this applies for numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/6/fb6d528b711388bc8a1757be4508e5b745d36d0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$33---&gt;99$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"110\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Hence, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/3/203c0eab90f96ef04dbdb3e91905e047749e0df4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19+15=34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" /> digits <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/2/20214fde09ebc162f29374eb899781449e3e3666.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies \\fbox{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can approximate the product with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/b/f2b7dad5a1b5d378ea8d2ca358f4a94b8f1d3ab4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{18} * 3.6 *10^{14} *3.4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"162\" height=\"15\" /> Now observe that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/c/e0ce08c025fd16b0b0d2cde619a719b301ff31a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.6*3.4&gt;10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" />, so we can further simplify the product with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/6/00636b63cdde618c5c532391d06d07c65195f7d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{18}*10^{14}*10=10^{33}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"172\" height=\"15\" /> which means the product has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/a/0fae83f77a53565850308d720ba8cb586af697aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{34 (C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"58\" height=\"28\" /> digits.\n</p><p>-serpent_121\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME\" title=\"1969 AHSME\">1969 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1969 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1969\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"